{"c":[{"id":"8a207191a07b0eec","sum":"First wake is python .summem/summem wake; the prompt intro names no invoked-as path. Root catalog lines are N: ./path, N the filename leaf grain from one ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem once).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260911T001036Z-0b56b4cb6829c2f7","text":"prompt_text intro is managed through SumMem only; first-wake is python .summem/summem wake; no invoked-as path","type":"note"},{"name":"20260915T225419Z-4b8f0ca4ed1bdaaf","text":"Root catalog lines are N: ./path; N is filename leaf grain from the same ls-files pass (loose note +1, nap stem once). Path is the ./ token.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"784324e867a813e8","sum":"Catalog N: is a count; --path on note, nap, recall, zoom walks up to the nearest store. Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns the ACK (no already-stored or do-not-retry).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260915T230226Z-c1e5723514aa52a8","text":"Catalog how-to: N: is a count; note --path <file> walks up to the nearest store. Same --path on nap, recall, zoom.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260915T230920Z-fd73dce7353c1e73","text":"Usage nap line is sequencing only; Saved. owns ACK (no already-stored / do-not-retry).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
